    [CI] Remove GLM5 and GLM4.7 scheduled cases and YAML files (#18013)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Remove the remaining GLM-5 (original version) and GLM-4.7 nightly/weekly
    cases, their YAML files, and obsolete scheduled-test references,
    following the cleanup scope of #17950.
    
    - Remove `glm-4.7-w8a8` from nightly and delete
    `tests/e2e/cases/models/configs/GLM/GLM-4.7.yaml`.
    - Remove `multi-node-glm4.7-w8a8c8-layerwise` from weekly and delete
    `tests/e2e/cases/features/kv_pool/GLM-4.7-W8A8C8-Mooncake-Layerwise.yaml`.
    - Remove `glm-5-w4a8` from weekly and delete
    `tests/e2e/cases/models/configs/GLM/GLM-5.yaml`.
    
    The latest main already removed the DeepSeek-V3.2/V3.2T scheduled
    entries and their YAML files. This PR removes the three remaining GLM
    cases and their files. GLM-5.1/5.2/5.3 are preserved.
    
    Also remove the GLM-4.7 nightly inventory row from the English
    documentation and Chinese translation, and delete the dead
    DeepSeek-V3.2-Exp installer function and its YAML-specific branch from
    the multi-node runner. PR-level tests, model provisioning lists, model
    implementations, and GLM-5.1/5.2/5.3 remain unchanged.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No runtime/API changes. The three removed cases are no longer available
    through nightly/weekly schedules, matrix-based comment dispatchers, or
    their deleted YAML files.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Parsed both YAML matrices and compared them against the latest main:
    only the three targeted entries were removed; all remaining entries are
    unchanged.
    - Ran `resolve_nightly_tests.py --mode matrix` across all 19 matrix
    sections and verified the generated JSON.
    - Ran the dispatch helper for all three removed cases and verified that
    every dispatch flag is false.
    - Scanned tracked repository files and verified that none reference the
    three deleted YAML files or the removed DSV3.2-Exp installer branch.
    - Bash syntax check for the modified multi-node runner: passed.
    - `git diff --check`: passed.
    - Pre-commit `codespell`, `typos`, and Markdown lint for the changed
    files: passed.
    - Full `bash format.sh ci` was attempted locally but remains blocked on
    installing the actionlint hook environment. CI will run the full
    pre-commit checks for this revision.
    
    No NPU runtime tests were run because this change removes CI cases,
    configuration files, documentation rows, and a dead installer branch.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
